{%- comment -%}
  Beg Borrow Steal Studio - Interactive FAQ Section (Rendered above footer)
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  .bbs-faq-section {
    background-color: #faf8f5;
    padding-top: 60px;
    padding-bottom: 70px;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, inherit);
    border-top: 1px solid #ede7df;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .bbs-faq-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 20px;
    padding-right: 20px;
  }

  .bbs-faq-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .bbs-faq-subtitle {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8c6239;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .bbs-faq-title {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 34px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #5a3a0a;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .bbs-faq-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #6b4d24;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .bbs-faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .bbs-faq-item {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #ede7df;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .bbs-faq-item:hover {
    border-color: #d4c5b3;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(90, 58, 10, 0.04);
  }

  .bbs-faq-summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #5a3a0a;
    user-select: none;
    list-style: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .bbs-faq-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .bbs-faq-summary:hover {
    color: #3b2403;
  }

  .bbs-faq-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #f7f3ee;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-left: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .bbs-faq-icon svg {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    stroke: #5a3a0a;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  details[open] .bbs-faq-summary {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f2ece4;
  }

  details[open] .bbs-faq-icon {
    background-color: #5a3a0a;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  details[open] .bbs-faq-icon svg {
    stroke: #ffffff;
  }

  .bbs-faq-content {
    padding: 18px 22px 22px 22px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #5a3a0a;
    animation: bbsFaqFadeIn 0.3s ease-out;
  }

  .bbs-faq-content p {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .bbs-faq-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .bbs-faq-footer-note {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #7a582c;
  }

  .bbs-faq-footer-note a {
    color: #5a3a0a;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @keyframes bbsFaqFadeIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .bbs-faq-section {
      padding-top: 40px;
      padding-bottom: 50px;
    }
    .bbs-faq-summary {
      padding: 15px 16px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .bbs-faq-content {
      padding: 15px 16px 18px 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="bbs-faq-section" id="bbs-store-faq">
  <div class="bbs-faq-container">
    <div class="bbs-faq-header">
      <div class="bbs-faq-subtitle">NEED HELP?</div>
      <h2 class="bbs-faq-title">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h2>
      <p class="bbs-faq-desc">Everything you need to know about our vintage curation, orders, shipping, and store visits.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bbs-faq-list">
      <details class="bbs-faq-item" open>
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>Are all pieces at Beg Borrow Steal Studio authentic?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Yes, every piece at Beg Borrow Steal Studio is rigorously inspected, vetted, and authenticated by our specialist curation team before being showcased.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>Where is your physical boutique studio located?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Our studio is located at <strong>Flat No 1, New Shams Building CHS, 76 Turner Road, Bandra West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400050</strong>. You are always warmly welcome to visit us in store!</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>What are your shipping and delivery timelines?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Orders are dispatched within 1–2 business days. Domestic deliveries across India generally arrive within 3–5 business days.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>What is your return & exchange policy?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Due to the exclusive and rare vintage nature of our curated inventory, all sales are final unless an item arrives defective or differs significantly from its description.</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="bbs-faq-item">
        <summary class="bbs-faq-summary">
          <span>Do you offer worldwide international shipping?</span>
          <span class="bbs-faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="bbs-faq-content">
          <p>Yes, we ship worldwide! International shipping rates and estimated delivery windows are automatically calculated at checkout based on your country.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="bbs-faq-footer-note">
      Have more questions? <a href="mailto:begborrowstealstudio@gmail.com">Get in touch with us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
